From 922886cf6a32c3e6e946ae711520212f4849768c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Farhan <farhanabdm@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 02:25:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(gi): split multi-value talent rows, Stellar damage, 4th
 passive

- A talent row with several values is split into one entry per value:
  "1-Hit Stellar-Conduct/Stellar Swirl DMG" gives "1-Hit Stellar-Conduct
  DMG" and "1-Hit Stellar Swirl DMG", "Low/High Plunge DMG" gives "Low
  Plunge DMG" and "High Plunge DMG". The editor uses the same names.
- Stellar-Conduct and Stellar Swirl values use GO's Stellar reaction
  damage formulas instead of showing a raw percentage.
- A 4th passive is imported and shown in the "passive" talent slot, with
  its own image slot.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Asb8vZRqeTYT9zLpVizGNv
